# Synthetic boot consoles. Neither file is a capture: both are written by hand in the ESP-IDF
# console shape, with a placeholder MAC (02:00:00 prefix) and invented versions, times and
# addresses, so the 56-of-67 line-coverage comparison has a fixture with the shape of the real
# one. The CR-stripping step is covered by the unit tests of crates/pemu-verify/src/normalize.rs.
